%% title: Push Platform Intent like any Project
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as estate repo CI
    participant O as ghcr
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant R as compiler binary
    CI->>R: validate Platform Intent
    CI->>O: publish the platform fragment
    CI->>S: deploy (GitHub OIDC token, platform)
    S->>S: cache the new copy
    S->>R: compose the estate
    S-->>CI: rollout stream
